#. module: incubacloud
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/incubacloud/models/cloud_host_posture.py:0
msgid ""
"Host %(host)s answers connections made straight to its address, although it "
"is set to accept only traffic through its trusted proxies: asked for "
"%(name)s at %(ip)s on port %(port)s, it answered \"%(answer)s\". Whoever "
"runs the hosts can close it from the host page: check that the proxy ranges "
"are applied to it, then Re-apply Hardening, which lets only those ranges in "
"on ports 80 and 443, and Push Trusted Proxy Settings."
msgstr ""
"El host %(host)s responde a conexiones hechas directamente a su dirección, "
"aunque está configurado para aceptar solo tráfico de sus proxies de "
"confianza: al pedirle %(name)s en %(ip)s por el puerto %(port)s, respondió "
"«%(answer)s». Puede cerrarlo quien administre los hosts, desde la ficha del "
"host: comprobar que se le aplican los rangos de proxy y después «Volver a "
"aplicar hardening», que solo deja entrar esos rangos por los puertos 80 y "
"443, y «Enviar ajustes de proxies de confianza»."

#. module: incubacloud
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/incubacloud/models/cloud_instance.py:0
msgid ""
"Host %(host)s is archived. Pick another host to revive this instance on."
msgstr ""
"El host %(host)s está archivado. Elija otro host en el que revivir esta "
"instancia."

#. module: incubacloud
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/incubacloud/models/cloud_host_posture.py:0
msgid ""
"Host %(host)s is set to accept only traffic through its trusted proxies, but"
" its firewall was last hardened to let anybody in on ports 80 and 443, so "
"its address bypasses the CDN. Whoever runs the hosts can close it from the "
"host page with Re-apply Hardening."
msgstr ""
"El host %(host)s está configurado para aceptar solo tráfico de sus proxies "
"de confianza, pero su último hardening dejó el cortafuegos abierto a "
"cualquiera en los puertos 80 y 443, así que su dirección permite saltarse el"
" CDN. Quien administre los hosts puede cerrarlo desde la ficha del host con "
"«Volver a aplicar hardening»."

#. module: incubacloud
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/incubacloud/models/cloud_host_posture.py:0
msgid ""
"Host %(host)s no longer accepts only traffic through its trusted proxies, "
"but its firewall still lets only them in on ports 80 and 443, so visitors "
"reaching it directly get no answer. Whoever runs the hosts can open it from "
"the host page with Re-apply Hardening."
msgstr ""
"El host %(host)s ya no acepta solo tráfico de sus proxies de confianza, pero"
" su cortafuegos sigue dejando entrar solo a ellos por los puertos 80 y 443, "
"así que quien llega directamente no obtiene respuesta. Quien administre los "
"hosts puede abrirlo desde la ficha del host con «Volver a aplicar "
"hardening»."

#. module: incubacloud
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/incubacloud/models/cloud_host_posture.py:0
msgid ""
"Host %(host)s was hardened before the panel recorded which hardening it "
"applied, so what its firewall and security settings hold now is unknown, and"
" the changes made to the recipe since may be missing. Whoever runs the hosts"
" can bring it up to date from the host page with Re-apply Hardening."
msgstr ""
"El host %(host)s se endureció antes de que el panel registrara qué hardening"
" le aplicaba, así que no se sabe qué tienen ahora su cortafuegos y sus "
"ajustes de seguridad, y pueden faltarle los cambios hechos desde entonces en"
" la receta. Quien administre los hosts puede ponerlo al día desde la ficha "
"del host con «Volver a aplicar hardening»."

#. module: incubacloud
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/incubacloud/models/cloud_host_posture.py:0
msgid ""
"Host %(host)s was hardened with an older recipe (%(applied)s) than the one "
"this panel ships (%(current)s), so the changes made since are not on it. "
"Whoever runs the hosts can bring it up to date from the host page with Re-"
"apply Hardening."
msgstr ""
"El host %(host)s se endureció con una receta anterior (%(applied)s) a la que"
" trae este panel (%(current)s), así que no tiene los cambios hechos desde "
"entonces. Quien administre los hosts puede ponerlo al día desde la ficha del"
" host con «Volver a aplicar hardening»."

#. module: incubacloud
#. odoo-python
