#. module: incubacloud
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:incubacloud.field_cloud_instance__secret_key
msgid ""
"The INCUBACLOUD_SECRET_KEY chain this instance's Odoo encrypts its own "
"secrets with (comma-separated Fernet keys, primary first). Generated with "
"the instance and written to .docker/incubacloud.env on every deploy and "
"rebuild; what the host already holds is merged in first, so no key is ever "
"dropped. A neutralized copy of production keeps its own."
msgstr ""
"La cadena INCUBACLOUD_SECRET_KEY con la que el Odoo de esta instancia cifra "
"sus propios secretos (claves Fernet separadas por comas, la principal "
"primero). Se genera con la instancia y se escribe en .docker/incubacloud.env"
" en cada despliegue y reconstrucción; antes se incorpora lo que ya tenga el "
"host, de modo que nunca se pierde una clave. Una copia neutralizada de "
"producción conserva la suya."

