#. module: incubacloud
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:incubacloud.field_cloud_instance__stack_template_ref
msgid ""
"The doodba template version this instance's stack was last rendered with "
"(copier's --vcs-ref). Empty for a stack rendered before the panel recorded "
