#: model:ir.model.fields,help:incubacloud.field_cloud_settings__metrics_delete_auth_key
msgid ""
"VictoriaMetrics' own key for deleting series. The central refuses every "
"deletion that does not carry it, and the gateway adds it on the operator's "
"deletion route only, so no account can delete anything — not even its own "
"series. Minted by the central deployment; empty means the central was "
"deployed before deletions existed and cannot delete yet."
msgstr ""
"Clave propia de VictoriaMetrics para borrar series. El central rechaza todo "
"borrado que no la lleve, y la pasarela solo la añade en la ruta de borrado "
"del operador, así que ninguna cuenta puede borrar nada, ni siquiera sus "
"propias series. La genera el despliegue del central; si está vacía, el "
"central se desplegó antes de que existieran los borrados y todavía no puede "
"borrar."

