msgstr "Sustituir"

#. module: incubacloud
#. odoo-javascript
#: code:addons/incubacloud/static/src/components/settings/core_sections.js:0
msgid ""
"Replacing it means redeploying the central and enrolling every host again."
msgstr ""
"Sustituirla obliga a volver a desplegar el central e inscribir de nuevo "
"todos los hosts."

#. module: incubacloud
#. odoo-javascript
#: code:addons/incubacloud/static/src/components/settings/core_sections.js:0
