msgstr "Secciones de la configuración"

#. module: incubacloud
#. odoo-javascript
#: code:addons/incubacloud/static/src/components/settings/settings_search_box.xml:0
msgid "Settings that match"
msgstr "Ajustes que coinciden"

#. module: incubacloud
#. odoo-javascript
#: code:addons/incubacloud/static/src/components/settings/settings.xml:0
msgid "Settings ›"
msgstr "Configuración ›"

#. module: incubacloud
#. odoo-javascript
#: code:addons/incubacloud/static/src/components/settings/github_settings_block.js:0
msgid ""
"Several installations found: %s. Type the right Installation ID under "
"Advanced."
msgstr ""
"Se encontraron varias instalaciones: %s. Escriba el ID de instalación "
"correcto en Avanzado."

#. module: incubacloud
#. odoo-javascript
#: code:addons/incubacloud/static/src/components/settings/core_sections.js:0
msgid "Signs every webhook GitHub sends."
msgstr "Firma cada webhook que envía GitHub."

#. module: incubacloud
#. odoo-javascript
#: code:addons/incubacloud/static/src/components/settings/core_settings_block.js:0
msgid "Source: the override above."
msgstr "Origen: la excepción de arriba."

#. module: incubacloud
#. odoo-javascript
#: code:addons/incubacloud/static/src/components/settings/core_settings_block.js:0
msgid "Source: the platform's CDN, refreshed daily."
msgstr "Origen: la CDN de la plataforma, actualizada a diario."

#. module: incubacloud
#. odoo-javascript
#: code:addons/incubacloud/static/src/components/settings/github_settings_block.xml:0
msgid ""
"Step 1 of 2. The panel sends you to GitHub to create an App with the right\n"
"                            permissions and webhook already set. It is created in your GitHub account,\n"
"                            and you can then install it on any organization you manage."
msgstr ""
"Paso 1 de 2. El panel le lleva a GitHub para crear una App con los permisos "
"y el webhook ya configurados. Se crea en su cuenta de GitHub, y después "
"puede instalarla en cualquier organización que administre."

#. module: incubacloud
#. odoo-javascript
#: code:addons/incubacloud/static/src/components/settings/github_settings_block.xml:0
msgid ""
"Step 2 of 2. Install the App on the GitHub organization that owns your\n"
"                            repositories, then come back and check the installation: the panel asks\n"
"                            GitHub for it and names the account it is installed on."
msgstr ""
"Paso 2 de 2. Instale la App en la organización de GitHub dueña de sus "
"repositorios, vuelva y verifique la instalación: el panel se la pide a "
"GitHub e indica la cuenta en la que está instalada."

#. module: incubacloud
#. odoo-javascript
#: code:addons/incubacloud/static/src/components/settings/core_sections.js:0
msgid ""
"The GitHub App that rebuilds on push and reads repositories, and a fallback "
"token."
msgstr ""
"La GitHub App que reconstruye con cada push y lee los repositorios, y un "
"token de respaldo."

#. module: incubacloud
#. odoo-javascript
#: code:addons/incubacloud/static/src/components/settings/github_settings_block.js:0
msgid "The GitHub App was not saved."
msgstr "No se guardó la GitHub App."

#. module: incubacloud
#. odoo-javascript
#: code:addons/incubacloud/static/src/components/settings/github_settings_block.js:0
msgid "The GitHub App's credentials were kept."
msgstr "Se conservaron las credenciales de la GitHub App."

#. module: incubacloud
#. odoo-javascript
#: code:addons/incubacloud/static/src/components/settings/core_sections.js:0
msgid "The app's key, used to mint installation tokens."
msgstr "La clave de la app, con la que se emiten los tokens de instalación."

#. module: incubacloud
#. odoo-javascript
#: code:addons/incubacloud/static/src/components/settings/settings.js:0
msgid "The changes on this page are not saved. Leave it and lose them?"
msgstr "Los cambios de esta página no están guardados. ¿Salir y perderlos?"

#. module: incubacloud
#. odoo-javascript
#: code:addons/incubacloud/static/src/components/settings/github_settings_block.xml:0
msgid ""
"The panel acts on the pushes and pull requests of this installation only.\n"
"                        A pull request on another account the App is installed on gets no preview,\n"
"                        and the production it would preview an alert naming that account."
msgstr ""
"El panel solo atiende los push y las pull requests de esta instalación. Una "
"pull request de otra cuenta en la que esté instalada la App no tiene vista "
"previa, y la producción que tendría la vista previa recibe una alerta con el"
" nombre de esa cuenta."

#. module: incubacloud
#. odoo-javascript
#: code:addons/incubacloud/static/src/components/settings/core_sections.js:0
msgid "The raw webhook payload is replaced by a short stub after this."
msgstr ""
"Pasado este tiempo, la carga útil original del webhook se sustituye por un "
"resumen breve."

#. module: incubacloud
#. odoo-javascript
#: code:addons/incubacloud/static/src/components/settings/github_settings_block.js:0
msgid ""
"This deletes the current GitHub App configuration. You will need to create "
"or configure a new app to restore the integration. Continue?"
msgstr ""
"Esto elimina la configuración actual de la GitHub App. Tendrá que crear o "
"configurar una app nueva para restablecer la integración. ¿Continuar?"

#. module: incubacloud
#. odoo-javascript
#: code:addons/incubacloud/static/src/components/settings/core_sections.js:0
#: code:addons/incubacloud/static/src/components/settings/core_settings_block.xml:0
msgid "Trusted proxies"
msgstr "Proxies de confianza"

#. module: incubacloud
#. odoo-javascript
#: code:addons/incubacloud/static/src/components/settings/settings_search_box.xml:0
msgid ""
"Try a shorter word, or what the setting does (“retention”, “proxy”, “smtp”)."
msgstr ""
"Pruebe con una palabra más corta, o con lo que hace el ajuste («retention», "
"«proxy», «smtp»)."

#. module: incubacloud
#. odoo-javascript
#: code:addons/incubacloud/static/src/components/settings/core_sections.js:0
msgid "Usage alert threshold"
msgstr "Umbral de aviso de uso"

#. module: incubacloud
#. odoo-javascript
#: code:addons/incubacloud/static/src/components/settings/settings_registry.js:0
msgid "Use a number."
msgstr "Use un número."

#. module: incubacloud
#. odoo-javascript
#: code:addons/incubacloud/static/src/components/settings/core_sections.js:0
msgid "Use a whole number followed by k, m or g, such as 10m."
msgstr "Use un número entero seguido de k, m o g, como 10m."

#. module: incubacloud
#. odoo-javascript
#: code:addons/incubacloud/static/src/components/settings/settings_registry.js:0
msgid "Use a whole number."
msgstr "Use un número entero."

#. module: incubacloud
#. odoo-javascript
#: code:addons/incubacloud/static/src/components/settings/core_sections.js:0
msgid ""
"Used by production instances when neither the project nor the instance names"
" one."
msgstr ""
"Lo usan las instancias de producción cuando ni el proyecto ni la instancia "
"indican uno."

#. module: incubacloud
#. odoo-javascript
#: code:addons/incubacloud/static/src/components/settings/core_sections.js:0
msgid ""
"VictoriaMetrics, Grafana and a gateway, deployed as a job on this host. Run "
"it again to move it."
msgstr ""
"VictoriaMetrics, Grafana y una pasarela, desplegados como trabajo en este "
"host. Vuelva a lanzarlo para moverlo."

#. module: incubacloud
#. odoo-javascript
#: code:addons/incubacloud/static/src/components/settings/core_sections.js:0
msgid ""
"Warn when an instance is unavailable longer than this during a move. 0 never"
" warns."
msgstr ""
"Avisar cuando una instancia no esté disponible más de este tiempo durante un"
" traslado. 0 nunca avisa."

#. module: incubacloud
#. odoo-javascript
#: code:addons/incubacloud/static/src/components/settings/core_settings_block.xml:0
msgid ""
"Webhook payloads are large (100 KB and more for a monorepo push). After the "
"truncation period the raw payload is replaced by a short stub; after the "
"deletion period the row goes. Unprocessed or failed events are never "
"deleted. 0 turns either off."
msgstr ""
"Las cargas de los webhooks son grandes (100 KB o más en un push de un "
"monorepo). Pasado el plazo de truncado, la carga original se sustituye por "
"un resumen breve; pasado el de eliminación, se va la fila. Los eventos sin "
"procesar o con error nunca se eliminan. 0 desactiva cualquiera de los dos."

#. module: incubacloud
#. odoo-javascript
#: code:addons/incubacloud/static/src/components/settings/core_sections.js:0
msgid "Webhook secret"
msgstr "Secreto del webhook"

#. module: incubacloud
#. odoo-javascript
#: code:addons/incubacloud/static/src/components/settings/core_sections.js:0
msgid ""
"What happens to instances over time: moves between hosts and unused "
"stagings."
msgstr ""
"Lo que pasa con las instancias con el tiempo: traslados entre hosts y "
"stagings sin uso."

#. module: incubacloud
#. odoo-javascript
#: code:addons/incubacloud/static/src/components/settings/core_sections.js:0
msgid ""
"Where each host's agent pushes. Agents on other hosts need a public HTTPS "
